OL,3,GNEWSASchool relocation plan 'would
OL,4,Aderail our lives'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA parent has said a proposal to move a
OL,7,FBerkshire primary school to new
OL,8,Fpremises five miles away would "derail"
OL,9,Fher family's lives.
OL,11,FIf approved the plan would see Bearwood
OL,12,FPrimary School, in Sindlesham, moved to
OL,13,Fa purpose-built site in Spencers Wood,
OL,14,Fwhich is set to open in September 2028.
OL,16,FWokingham Borough Council said the need
OL,17,Ffor places was falling in the school's
OL,18,Fcurrent location, but increasing in
OL,19,FShinfield and Spencers Wood.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
